        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Petty, Bobby Gillespie\n- Bands: Tom Petty and the Heartbreakers, Traveling Wilburys, Mudcrutch, Primal Scream, The Jesus and Mary Chain\n- Roles: lead singer, co-founder, founding member, drummer, pseudonyms\n\nFacts:\n- In the mid-1980s, Bobby Gillespie was the drummer for The Jesus and Mary Chain.\n- In the late 1980s, Tom Petty was a member and co-founder of the supergroup Traveling Wilburys, where he used the pseudonyms Charlie T. Wilbury Jr. and Muddy Wilbury.\n- Tom Petty is best known as the lead singer of Tom Petty and the Heartbreakers.\n- Tom Petty was also a member of his early band Mudcrutch.\n- Bobby Gillespie is the lead singer and a founding member of Primal Scream.",
